1001
00:42:18,433 --> 00:42:20,133
- Go, go, go!
- Go, go, go, go, go!

1002
00:42:20,133 --> 00:42:24,367
- Come on, out, out, out!
- Go, go, go, go!

1003
00:42:24,367 --> 00:42:26,633
- Good thing I hung on to this.

1004
00:42:26,633 --> 00:42:27,933
