1033
00:43:22,767 --> 00:43:25,000
- [Tom Serv] There, star
baby is diapered, Mike!

1034
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,833
- [Crow] What should we do
with the dirty diaper, Mike?

1035
00:43:26,833 --> 00:43:29,167
