1045
00:43:58,300 --> 00:44:01,000
(engine revving)

1046
00:44:04,633 --> 00:44:06,333
- Powered by a
20-horse Evinrude,

1047
00:44:06,333 --> 00:44:08,667
this Dodge Charger really...

1048
00:44:09,833 --> 00:44:11,300
♪ Love the one you're with ♪

1049
00:44:11,300 --> 00:44:12,433
♪ Love the one you're with ♪

1050
00:44:12,433 --> 00:44:15,667
♪ Do do do do do do ♪

1051
00:44:15,667 --> 00:44:19,133
