1057
00:44:28,367 --> 00:44:32,967
- I got my ankle caught between
two rocks, I'm pretty stuck!

1058
00:44:32,967 --> 00:44:33,800
- Hello?

1059
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:35,100
Anybody?

1060
00:44:35,100 --> 00:44:37,867
- I had the most marvelous time!

1061
00:44:37,867 --> 00:44:39,100
- I'll bet.

1062
00:44:39,100 --> 00:44:40,767
