1064
00:44:43,833 --> 00:44:45,400
- Dennis Cole!

1065
00:44:45,400 --> 00:44:49,700
- His horn is caught in
some kind of bebop rhythm.

1066
00:44:49,700 --> 00:44:51,400
- Hey, Froggy!

1067
00:44:51,400 --> 00:44:53,100
- Keep it down!

1068
00:44:53,100 --> 00:44:55,333
- Just let me Deezen by ya!

1069
00:44:57,067 --> 00:44:58,300
- Billy's so good,
he'll just wait

1070
00:44:58,300 --> 00:45:00,833
