1071
00:45:00,833 --> 00:45:04,067
♪ I am the lizard king ♪

1072
00:45:07,967 --> 00:45:09,333
(whooshing)

1073
00:45:09,333 --> 00:45:11,067
(booming)

1074
00:45:11,067 --> 00:45:13,067
