1079
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:25,233
- That could've killed, it
could've killed all of us!

1080
00:45:25,233 --> 00:45:26,433
- We'd better get in the house.

1081
00:45:26,433 --> 00:45:28,367
- I'll call the police!

1082
00:45:30,333 --> 00:45:33,967
