1085
00:45:40,100 --> 00:45:41,667
- Ungar, Jeep, do you hear me?

1086
00:45:41,667 --> 00:45:42,533
- Great.

1087
00:45:42,533 --> 00:45:43,900
- Dumb cop and dumb cop.

1088
00:45:43,900 --> 00:45:45,400
They're dumb cops.

1089
00:45:46,567 --> 00:45:49,933
