1098
00:46:09,867 --> 00:46:12,133
a layer of protective
mucus that...

1099
00:46:12,133 --> 00:46:13,733
- Hold it, give me a bite!

1100
00:46:13,733 --> 00:46:16,000
- He's eating his own hand!

1101
00:46:19,033 --> 00:46:21,000
- Are you saying I
have an oral fixation?

1102
00:46:21,000 --> 00:46:22,567
- Jeep, Ungar, get in here!

1103
00:46:22,567 --> 00:46:24,300
- Chief Hummer, what?

1104
00:46:27,133 --> 00:46:28,533
- Nice of you to show up.

1105
00:46:28,533 --> 00:46:30,033
- (burping) You're welcome.

1106
00:46:30,033 --> 00:46:31,533
