1142
00:47:43,300 --> 00:47:46,733
- The President stops
at the Westward Ho.

1143
00:47:46,733 --> 00:47:50,167
- Why did he take
the long way around?

1144
00:47:50,167 --> 00:47:51,867
- Let me see, oh,
that one's locked too,

1145
00:47:51,867 --> 00:47:55,800
I gotta go get a
hanger, gosh darn it.

1146
00:47:55,800 --> 00:47:59,867
