stark beauty of this town.

1147
00:47:59,867 --> 00:48:02,400
(typing)

1148
00:48:02,400 --> 00:48:03,933
- And action!

1149
00:48:03,933 --> 00:48:04,767
Action!

1150
00:48:04,767 --> 00:48:06,333
- Come on in here.

1151
00:48:06,333 --> 00:48:08,233
- Ah, your copier down?

1152
00:48:10,500 --> 00:48:11,833
- What can I do for you, fella?

1153
00:48:11,833 --> 00:48:13,667
- I presume you've
heard of Tattletale.

1154
00:48:13,667 --> 00:48:15,400
- First you take your
feet off the desk,

1155
00:48:15,400 --> 00:48:17,233
second take the cigar
out of your mouth,

1156
00:48:17,233 --> 00:48:18,567
and third you stand up.

1157
00:48:18,567 --> 00:48:20,300
- Fourth you lick me.

1158
00:48:21,633 --> 00:48:23,133
- Who the hell are you?

1159
00:48:23,133 --> 00:48:26,500
- Well, let me show you
my Sam's Club membership.

1160
00:48:26,500 --> 00:48:30,233
- The man bearing this wallet
