1161
00:48:30,233 --> 00:48:33,400
- Excuse me, Mr.
Craig, I didn't know.

1162
00:48:36,200 --> 00:48:39,700
- I gotta go buy
Fish's laxative.

1163
00:48:39,700 --> 00:48:42,033
- Wow, who's the skirt?

1164
00:48:42,033 --> 00:48:44,367
