1165
00:48:44,367 --> 00:48:46,133
- Won't you sit down, sir?

1166
00:48:46,133 --> 00:48:48,467
- I may sit down, I may not.

1167
00:48:49,933 --> 00:48:51,567
- Sheriff, where
are you currently

1168
