I say otherwise.

1183
00:49:26,367 --> 00:49:27,567
Understood?

1184
00:49:27,567 --> 00:49:29,667
- I understand, tan
man with wallet.

1185
00:49:29,667 --> 00:49:31,300
- Understood.

1186
00:49:31,300 --> 00:49:33,133
(futuristic music)

1187
00:49:33,133 --> 00:49:35,300
- Hey, it's new shirt day!

1188
00:49:38,667 --> 00:49:40,900
- Good thing my Zantigo
salary affords me

1189
00:49:40,900 --> 00:49:42,867
