1191
00:49:46,600 --> 00:49:47,933
(Crow laughing)

1192
00:49:47,933 --> 00:49:49,500
- You don't look so bad, Billy.

1193
00:49:49,500 --> 00:49:50,767
(Tom Servo yelping)
- I feel so good,

1194
00:49:50,767 --> 00:49:52,533
