lump on your chest?

1196
00:49:54,800 --> 00:49:56,700
- Oh, that's my nipple.

1197
00:49:57,867 --> 00:49:59,900
- I got it from
the Franklin Mint.

1198
00:49:59,900 --> 00:50:02,767
- My God, Billy, it's bigger!

1199
00:50:02,767 --> 00:50:05,867
- You know nothing
of my chest holes.

1200
00:50:07,500 --> 00:50:09,600
- Yeah, it seems like.

1201
00:50:09,600 --> 00:50:11,967
