1202
00:50:11,967 --> 00:50:15,533
- Duh, I'm a dork (chuckling).

1203
00:50:15,533 --> 00:50:17,700
- Okay gun it, please, oh.

1204
00:50:23,733 --> 00:50:26,567
- Tonight on a very special
Roddy McDowall Hospital.

1205
00:50:26,567 --> 00:50:27,400
- Hey!

1206
00:50:28,900 --> 00:50:32,700
