doorbell on your chest.

1208
00:50:35,900 --> 00:50:37,267
- Hmm, I was in a monkey suit

1209
00:50:37,267 --> 00:50:40,067
then suddenly I
was in this movie.

1210
00:50:43,267 --> 00:50:47,033
- Oh, dear God, Mrs. Mither
was a long, long time ago.

1211
00:50:47,033 --> 00:50:48,533
- Can I get dressed
now, Dr. Mellon?

1212
00:50:48,533 --> 00:50:50,833
- Certainly Bright Eyes, oh.

1213
00:50:51,800 --> 00:50:52,667
- No, not yet.

1214
00:50:52,667 --> 00:50:54,167
- It is ape law.

1215
00:50:54,167 --> 00:50:55,833
- Come in the other room.

1216
00:50:55,833 --> 00:50:57,633
- Take off my clothes.

1217
00:50:58,600 --> 00:51:00,133
- Lie down, Billy.

1218
00:51:00,133 --> 00:51:04,200
- But don't rip the paper,
I'd like to save it.

1219
00:51:04,200 --> 00:51:05,933
- Well, I'm going in.

1220
00:51:11,200 --> 00:51:12,200
- Ding dong.

1221
00:51:13,500 --> 00:51:14,500
- Operation!

1222
00:51:14,500 --> 00:51:15,967
- Remove wrenched ankle.

1223
00:51:15,967 --> 00:51:17,400
- Does that hurt?

1224
00:51:17,400 --> 00:51:18,600
- No, doctor.

1225
00:51:18,600 --> 00:51:21,333
- What if I stomp up
and down on your chest?

1226
00:51:21,333 --> 00:51:25,700
- Well, it looks as if you
have an impacted wood tick.

1227
00:51:25,700 --> 00:51:30,200
- Frankly, Billy, I'm
baffled and grossed out.

1228
00:51:30,200 --> 00:51:31,800
- Ding dong.

1229
00:51:31,800 --> 00:51:32,633
Ding dong.

1230
00:51:34,167 --> 00:51:35,000
- That?

1231
00:51:35,933 --> 00:51:37,100
- It appears to be growing into

1232
00:51:37,100 --> 00:51:39,733
