commemorative plate.

1233
00:51:39,733 --> 00:51:40,633
(tapping)

1234
00:51:40,633 --> 00:51:41,967
- Uh, come in.

1235
00:51:41,967 --> 00:51:43,567
- Do you feel that?

1236
00:51:43,567 --> 00:51:44,367
- No.

1237
00:51:46,067 --> 00:51:47,467
- Well, medical science has done

1238
00:51:47,467 --> 00:51:50,167
everything possible, good-bye.

1239
00:51:50,167 --> 00:51:51,467
- Quite frankly...

